(4) Evaluate the following sum: (1/(√X+Y) + 1/(√Z+W) + … + 1/(√M+N)) × (√M+Y), where the definitions of X, Y, Z, W, M, and N are not completely specified.

Note: All designated letters represent numbers with relationships or values that have not been fully provided.

