Assuming the configuration shown is valid, determine the length of side $y$.

A circle of radius 1 is surrounded by 4 circles of radius r as shown. What is r?

[asy]
unitsize(0.6cm);
for(int i=0; i<2; ++i){
for(int j=0; j<2; ++j){
