Given that 3sin α + 4cos α
(1) Find the value of tan α;
(2) Find the value of cot (3π/2 - α) · sin² (3π/2 + α).

In any isosceles triangle PQR with PQ = PR, the altitude PS bisects the base QR so that QS = RS. Given that the triangle sides are PQ = PR = 15 and the entire base length QR = 20.

