Let \(\alpha\), \(\beta\), and \(\gamma\) be positive real numbers. Find the minimum value of

$$
\begin{aligned}
A & = \sqrt{\Bigl(\alpha - z_{1} - \cdots - z_{n}\Bigr)^2 + x_{n}^2 + y_{n}^2} + \\
& \quad \sqrt{z_{n}^2 + x_{n-1}^2 + y_{n-1}^2} + \cdots + \sqrt{z_{2}^2 + x_{1}^2 + y_{1}^2} + \\
& \quad \sqrt{z_{1}^2 + \Bigl(\beta - x_{1} - \cdots - x_{n}\Bigr)^2 + \Bigl(\gamma - y_{1} - \cdots - y_{n}\Bigr)^2}
\end{aligned}
$$

