A food factory processes mushrooms, with a cost of 20 yuan per kilogram of mushrooms, and a processing fee of t yuan per kilogram (t is a constant, and 2 ≤ t ≤ 5). Assume the factory price per kilogram of mushrooms is x yuan (25 ≤ x ≤ 40). According to market research, the sales volume q is inversely proportional to e^x, and when the factory price per kilogram of mushrooms is 30 yuan, the daily sales volume is 100 kilograms.  
