In the diagram, if \(\angle PQR = 48^\circ\), what is the measure of \(\angle PMN\)? [asy]

size(6cm);

pair p = (0, 0); pair m = dir(180 - 24); pair n = dir(180 + 24); pair r = 1.3 * dir(24); pair q = 2 * 1.3 * Cos(48) * dir(-24);

