Given the function f(x)=2√3tan(x/2+π/4)cos²(x/2+π/4)-sin(x+π).
(I) Find the domain and the minimum positive period of f(x);
(II) If the graph of f(x) is shifted to the right by π/6 units to obtain the graph of function g(x), find the maximum and minimum values of function g(x) on the interval [0,π].

Given a circle and a line l with a slope of 1 that intersects the circle at points A and B.

