Select 5 people from a group of boys and girls to join a math extracurricular group. How many different ways are there to select under the following conditions?

 (1) Exactly 2 boys and 3 girls must be selected, and one particular girl is included;

 (2) The selection includes no more than a certain number of girls, and a particular boy and a different particular girl cannot both be in the group at the same time.

