In cube \( ABCD A_{1} B_{1} C_{1} D_{1} \), points \( M \) and \( N \) are located somewhere on edges \( AB \) and \( B_{1} C_{1} \) respectively. A point \( K \) is chosen arbitrarily on edge \( DC \). Find:

a) The distance from point \( N \) to line \( AK \);

