(2) Given that $A$ is an internal angle of $\triangle ABC$, and $$f\left( \frac {A}{2}\right)= \frac {1}{2}+ \frac { \sqrt {3}}{2},\quad a=1,\;b= \sqrt {2}$$, find the area of $\triangle ABC$.

